
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Book Corner | Discover Your Next Read</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">YOUR LITTLE CORNER OF BOOKS</p>

    <h1>Find your next <span>favourite</span> book.</h1>

    <p class="description">
      Explore stories, discover new authors, and find a book
      that feels like it was written just for you.
    </p>

    <form action="/search" method="GET" class="search-form">
      <input
        type="search"
        name="q"
        placeholder="Search by title or author..."
        aria-label="Search by title or author"
        required
      >
      <button type="submit">Discover books</button>
    </form>
  </header>
</body>
</html>
